Name: libdisplay-info
URL: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/emersion/libdisplay-info
Version: 0.4.0
Revision: c67a3e9bedb05ab61c7443704a1a107e76254595
Update Mechanism: Manual (https://crbug.com/503546519)
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Shipped: no
Security Critical: no

Description:
EDID and DisplayID library.

This is only used in tests.

Local Modifications:
None.

When updating to a new version, update the Revision above with the new commit hash,
and perform the following steps:
1. Download pnp.ids from the latest hwdata release
   (https://github.com/vcrhonek/hwdata/tags; v0.412 was used last), e.g.
   `curl -L -o /tmp/pnp.ids https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vcrhonek/hwdata/v0.412/pnp.ids`
2. Run the following script:
   `third_party/libdisplay-info/src/tool/gen-search-table.py /tmp/pnp.ids third_party/libdisplay-info/pnp-id-table.c pnp_id_table`
3. `sed -i '/Laser Maste/s/$/ \/\/ nocheck/' third_party/libdisplay-info/pnp-id-table.c`
4. Add any new sources from the upstream meson.build to BUILD.gn.
5. Check in the generated pnp-id-table.c along with the changes for the update.
